    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Discover ultimate luxury in Clonakilty with this magnificent new build 5-bed, A-rated home. A showhouse it features unrivalled, high-end finishes, offering exceptional energy efficiency and grand family living in a quiet, exclusive neighbourhood just minutes from the vibrant town centre.\n\nConstruction is complete at Sruthan Beag and this is the final home remaining for sale.\n \nThis exceptional brand-new, A-rated five-bedroom detached residence in Clonakilty combines elite modern efficiency, sweeping family space, and a premier address. \n\n\nProperty Highlights:\n\n•A-Rated Efficiency: Cutting-edge air-to-water heating and supreme insulation for near-zero energy bills.\n•5 Generous Bedrooms: Bright, expansive rooms including a master ensuite with custom walk-in wardrobe provisions.\n•Exquisite Interior: High ceilings, bespoke joinery, premium flooring, and a state-of-the-art designer kitchen.\n\nLocation & Lifestyle:\n\n•Prestigious Setting: Tucked away in one of Clonakilty`s most desirable, leafy, and peaceful private estates.\n•Town Convenience: Only a few minutes drive or leisurely stroll to Clonakilty`s award-winning restaurants, cafes, and shops.\n•Coastal Proximity: Just a short 8-minute drive to the famous blue-flag beach at Inchydoney Island.\n\nAccommodation\n\nHall 2.15 m x 4.4 m\n\nLounge Area 4.3 m x 4.25 m \n\nKitchen / Dining Area 7.4 m x 3.6 m\n\nUtility Room 1.85 x 1.55 m \n\nWC 1.5 m x 1 m \n\nLiving Room 4.35 m x 5.5 m \n\nBedroom Five/Study 3.6 m x 5.5 m \n\nStairs to first floor \n\nMaster bedroom 4.35 x 3.8m \n\nWalk in Wardrobe 3.15 m x 1.6 m \n\nBedroom Two 4.3 m x 4 m \n\nEnsuite 2.1 m x 2.2 m \n\nBedroom Three 3.95 m x 3.9 m \n\nBathroom 3.65 m x 2.2 m \n\nBedroom Four 3.15 m x 3.6 m"
      },
